# A planted ledger: the import of the shared library and the import of the archive of the link line.
format 1
rule artifact-symbols
configuration planted kind planted
configuration planted tier planted
@build/libcrucible.a | host-ratchet | 1 | crucible_plant_host_call | -
@build/libcrucible.a | static-ratchet | 1 | crucible_plant_static_call | -
